  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Acrobatics, Disguise, Escape Artist, and Sleight of Hand as class skills. You may use the better of your Dexterity or Charisma modifier when using one of these skills (chosen when you gain this talent) to entertain or interact with a creature that is aware of you (including escaping from a grapple or tumbling through a creature’s space). You may select this talent a second time, in which case you may use the better of the two ability score modifiers on all of the chosen skills.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/vocation#toc62\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
